From: CervantesHallo <227578309+CervantesHallo@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [porting] mmdevapi: Arm notifications before sampling effective defaults.

Cider-Topic: audio/notifications
Base: wine-mirror/wine 7b3fff76fa5178f6ce0141b2c776afa2a822f101.
Status: candidate prerequisite for WinMM metadata; not runtime-accepted.
Register only after an armed baseline, with bounded readiness outside the
notification lock. Compare effective endpoint role IDs so communications
fallback follows console. Preserve opaque IDs, real failures and event ownership.

